{"version":1,"content":"<p>現年28歲的內地頂流小生張凌赫挾古裝劇《逐玉》成功邁向國際，連外媒都專程飛抵橫店貼身追訪，直擊苦候20日的「聯合國粉絲」夾道冒雨追星，墟冚場面似足劇中角色「武安侯」凱旋歸來！</p><p>他更憑一己之力帶動當地經濟圈，獲睇好成為「華流第一人」。</p><p>&lt;b</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-20T16:24:27.137886+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":119,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-20T16:01:44+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-20T16:17:35.764721+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-20T16:17:35.764721+00:00","content_hash":"6e79db364b1a3b1f2be0787013eb5877cd85305ddea5ed23ce21b9d6469001bd","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}